  "text": "Beneath the lamps’ ethereal, pale light,\nHe walked the streets in the dead of night.\nEach footfall echoed, stark and clear,\nAgainst the pavement, cold and near.\n\nLike ghosts they passed, a spectral crowd,\nWith faces lost, unbound, unbowed.\nBuried deep in worlds of their own,\nThey never met his gaze, alone.\n\nAmidst the sea of urban stone,\nHe stood in solitude, all alone.\n\nThe animal known for its long neck is the **giraffe**."
